#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:44 3ba3d4dc9c2040c4a3aa4c71ab3cb418
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:45 53a1014b54b2413899c29f41ad9ee4f5
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default on the R1 and T1 (UART1) pads (CRSF or "
"ELRS). The SBUS pad is inverted and applied to R1."
msgstr "RC输入默认配置在R1和T1（UART1）焊盘（CRSF或ELRS）。SBUS焊盘经反相后接至R1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:47 19e8887b48d240ef9ac7bc49059d50e3
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:48 be426068c6eb44cea2b4babb037f05a1
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T1 and :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to “7”."
msgstr "FPort需连接T1，且须将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:49 966d901a99144b6a90b7ec897cd7b749
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T1 connection, in addition to R1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to “0”."
msgstr ""
"CRSF除需连接R1外，还需连接T1，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:50 b700099d38264f9eb18bd33ba26077be
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connecton to T1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr "SRXL2需连接T1，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:52 15134edbd0454736a0490a415a1f119f
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems "
"<common-rc-systems>` for details."
msgstr ""
"在ArduPilot中，任意UART均可用于RC系统连接，兼容除PPM以外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`Radio Control Systems"
" <common-rc-systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:55 ea59ac0cb28246158cf70ed84cb91bdf
msgid "OSD"
msgstr "OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:56 24a04fdb3fde4faba8dc4847749ea120
msgid "Use of internal MAX7456 for analog OSD/VTX is enabled by default."
msgstr "默认启用内置MAX7456模拟OSD/图传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:57 1d0270f1327c480bba79285823494b60
msgid ""
"Simultaneous HD VTX OSD supportcan is configured on UART4 (DisplayPort)."
msgstr "HD图传OSD同时支持已配置在UART4（DisplayPort）上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:60 b8a3c97b26b94e79b8b073d1a0b90940
msgid "PWM Outputs"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:61 0e853e31f6604081b32cd834bd8ad312
msgid ""
"The autopilot supports up to 9 PWM outputs (PWM 9 is defaulted to serial LED"
" support). Outputs 1-4 are available via a standard ESC JST-SH connector and"
" solder pads for M5-M8. All outputs support  all PWM types. PWM 1-4 and 6-9 "
"support DShot. PWM 1-4 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"飞控最多支持9路PWM输出（PWM 9默认为串行LED支持）。输出1-4通过标准ESC JST-"
"SH连接器引出，M5-M8通过焊盘引出。所有输出均支持所有PWM类型。PWM 1-4和6-9支持DShot。PWM 1-4支持双向DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:63 987f307f9c1740bd9a39552065b5b339
msgid "The PWM is in 5 groups:"
msgstr "PWM分为5组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:66 77014a37c5a44b5da8125d0cfbe5ce13
msgid "PWM 1,2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:67 7d9e343ec41542c9810b8d5ce57db4eb
msgid "PWM 3,4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:68 56a0483fc1624e259fc0eb6d556b8186
msgid "PWM 5   in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:69 41476d1d2b804b7bb30a60c2bbb4216d
msgid "PWM 6,7 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 6、7 在第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:70 fd22ac28224b43ca84b7b5e2911607b2
msgid "PWM 8,9 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 8、9 在第5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:72 83778a018c8c46568a32a7f3a77230f7
msgid "Pads for Outputs 1-8 are available on bottom side of pcb"
msgstr "输出1-8的焊盘位于PCB底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:73 ba58d6c72d284386a0a7281272f2201a
msgid "ESC port is a jst-sh V-G-C-R3-1-2-3-4"
msgstr "ESC接口为JST-SH V-G-C-R3-1-2-3-4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:75 9bab0ffa0632459390f35346efb628cf
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. All "
"channels in specific Timer groups are configured either as DSHOT or PWM, "
"mixing of protocols within groups is not possible. Channel 9 is configured "
"as NeoPixel by default but can be configured for and extra PWM output. PWM 8"
" cannot be used for DShot if PWM 9 is configured for NeoPixel."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率。每个定时器组内的所有通道统一配置为DShot或PWM，组内不支持混用协议。通道9默认配置为NeoPixel，但也可配置为额外的PWM输出。若PWM"
" 9配置为NeoPixel，则PWM 8无法使用DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:78 8a04c312134f4864af165654d453e972
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:79 4f57575305484755b12050f1c3c3fba2
msgid ""
"The board has a builtin voltage sensor and pin on ESC connector for external"
" currrent sensor. Voltage sensor supports up to 6S LiPo."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器，并在ESC接口上提供外部电流传感器引脚。电压传感器最高支持6S LiPo。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:81 2b97b53d3161403c87743baefdf1881d
msgid "The default battery configuration is:"
msgstr "默认电池配置为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:83 4a0838aeff74456f8860fe61fe16026f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:84 5e2e2b26499440598f65d76cfa6653e8
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 14"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 14"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:85 13146459c15648e2947305ff06fa7cb2
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11 (CURR pin)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11（CURR引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:86 b5bc5f4288c34e0db613fd038a42bf56
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:87 643002a28f7f439a918782913ec40fbf
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 37"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 37"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:90 5f918ef728d04781acc95442b271218c
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:91 a1f28231e3d04a698bc92f3e0b1f45e6
msgid ""
"The autopilot does not have a built-in compass, however you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "本飞控无内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL焊盘使用I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:94 635c4511c26b426eaaaebebee41d8147
msgid "Firmware¶"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:95 e026837f9283420591b78cdd095cb453
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__  in sub-folders labeled “BrahmaF4”."
msgstr "该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的 「BrahmaF4」 子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:98 d832df95ac9e4df0866ec5aab72a180e
msgid "Loading Firmware¶"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:99 bf4bb6d43253450aa0065ea4b4ea7717
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the “with_bl.hex” firmware, "
"using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "首次固件加载可通过DFU完成：按住引导程序按钮并插入USB。然后使用您常用的DFU工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brahmaf4.rst:101 ec9f1fa3e626458590cd2e3f284d7887
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。后续更新请使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
